                    <h2 class="main_head" data-aos="fade-up">Residential Solar Rooftop Solutions</h2>
                    <!--<p>Ksquare Energy is widely recognized for its <b>on-grid residential rooftop solar systems</b>, especially in <b>Gujarat</b>, where it has completed over <b>8,000+ rooftop projects</b>.</p>-->
                    <p>Ksquare Energy is widely recognized for its on-grid Residential Solar Rooftop Solutions, delivering trusted solar for home and home solar system installations across Gujarat. With over 8,000+ successful rooftop projects, Ksquare ensures energy savings, sustainability, and long-term value for households. Switch to solar today with Ksquare Energy and start reducing your electricity bills while contributing to a greener future.</p>
