    <!-- section-7 -->
    <section class="pt-70">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row justify-content-between">
                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <h4 class="main_head"><span>FAQs</span></h4>
                    <p>About Rooftop Solar in Gujarat</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-7">
                    <div class="accordion accordion-flush" id="accordionFlushExample">
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h5 class="accordion-header" id="flush-headingOne">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#flush-collapseOne" aria-expanded="false"
                                    aria-controls="flush-collapseOne">
                                    What are the key components of a commercial rooftop solar system?
                                </button>
                            </h5>
                            <div id="flush-collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                aria-labelledby="flush-headingOne" data-bs-parent="#accordionFlushExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    A commercial rooftop solar system typically includes solar panels, inverters, mounting structures, net metering units, monitoring systems, and electrical safety equipment. These components work together to convert solar energy into usable power, enabling a reliable rooftop solar installation for large-scale consumption.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h5 class="accordion-header" id="flush-headingTwo">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#flush-collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false"
                                    aria-controls="flush-collapseTwo">
                                    What are the environmental benefits of installing rooftop solar for industries?
                                </button>
                            </h5>
                            <div id="flush-collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                aria-labelledby="flush-headingTwo" data-bs-parent="#accordionFlushExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">Installing a rooftop solar power system helps industries reduce their carbon footprint, conserve natural resources, and cut down on greenhouse gas emissions. By choosing solar power roofs, businesses actively contribute to a cleaner, more sustainable future.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h5 class="accordion-header" id="flush-headingThree">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#flush-collapseThree" aria-expanded="false"
                                    aria-controls="flush-collapseThree">
                                    How does rooftop solar reduce operational costs for businesses?
                                </button>
                            </h5>
                            <div id="flush-collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                aria-labelledby="flush-headingThree" data-bs-parent="#accordionFlushExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">With a commercial rooftop solar setup, businesses can significantly lower their monthly electricity bills. By generating power on-site through solar panels on the roof, companies reduce dependence on grid electricity and benefit from long-term energy savings and better financial planning.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h5 class="accordion-header" id="flush-headingFour">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#flush-collapseFour" aria-expanded="false"
                                    aria-controls="flush-collapseFour">
                                    How can large-scale rooftop solar systems be supported for industrial facilities?
                                </button>
                            </h5>
                            <div id="flush-collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                aria-labelledby="flush-headingFour" data-bs-parent="#accordionFlushExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">Scalable rooftop solar installations are designed to meet the high energy demands of industrial facilities. With proper assessment, system design, and load analysis, industries can install solar rooftop systems that align with their energy needs while maximizing efficiency and ROI.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h5 class="accordion-header" id="flush-headingFive">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#flush-collapseFive" aria-expanded="false"
                                    aria-controls="flush-collapseFive">
                                    What government policies or subsidies apply to industrial rooftop solar setups?
                                </button>
                            </h5>
                            <div id="flush-collapseFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                aria-labelledby="flush-headingFive" data-bs-parent="#accordionFlushExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">Many government initiatives, including Rooftop Solar Schemes, provide financial incentives, accelerated depreciation, and subsidies for eligible industrial rooftop solar projects. These policies aim to promote faster adoption of rooftop solar systems across commercial and industrial sectors.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h5 class="accordion-header" id="flush-headingSix">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#flush-collapseSix" aria-expanded="false"
                                    aria-controls="flush-collapseSix">
                                    What warranties and service support are usually offered on rooftop solar systems?
                                </button>
                            </h5>
                            <div id="flush-collapseSix" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                aria-labelledby="flush-headingSix" data-bs-parent="#accordionFlushExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">Most rooftop solar panel providers offer warranties of 10–25 years on solar modules and around 5–10 years on inverters. Additionally, comprehensive service support, including annual maintenance and remote monitoring, ensures the solar rooftop for home or industry runs optimally throughout its lifespan.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h5 class="accordion-header" id="flush-headingSeven">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#flush-collapseSeven" aria-expanded="false"
                                    aria-controls="flush-collapseSeven">
                                    Does rooftop solar affect the structural integrity of a building?
                                </button>
                            </h5>
                            <div id="flush-collapseSeven" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                aria-labelledby="flush-headingSeven" data-bs-parent="#accordionFlushExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">No, when properly installed, a rooftop solar system does not harm the structural strength of a building. A thorough site inspection and load-bearing analysis are done before installation to ensure that the solar roof panels are safely integrated without compromising the building's durability.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h5 class="accordion-header" id="flush-headingEight">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#flush-collapseEight" aria-expanded="false"
                                    aria-controls="flush-collapseEight">
                                    Can rooftop solar systems be installed on RCC, metal, or tiled roofs?
                                </button>
                            </h5>
                            <div id="flush-collapseEight" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                aria-labelledby="flush-headingEight" data-bs-parent="#accordionFlushExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">Yes, rooftop solar panels can be efficiently installed on RCC (concrete roofs), metal sheds, and tiled rooftops using the right mounting solutions. Each type requires a specific installation approach to ensure optimal panel orientation, safety, and long-term performance.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
